    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/b85c226e6f734d5c06aa18a17922e0c9.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div>Food Factory is game where players can produce food using various machines starting from gathering base products. Buy lands for your factory, build efficient production lines, expand, gather, explore. Drive more than 10 vehicles, including harvesters, forklifts trucks, pickups and even Tuskla. Export your finished products or deliver them to local sellers. Use different side missions to gather money. You can even furnish your home or factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/3cddae9232a9173b7f24dad5f37375a7.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div><strong>Grow several types of different plants.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/d6acdbf333b31f02347e06cf07c9b799.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/d6acdbf333b31f02347e06cf07c9b799.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/d6acdbf333b31f02347e06cf07c9b799.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/e3fa2840b2a69484f668a9ec557eda08.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div><strong>Build your factory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/9672668c4c84956b4437e307a1878eaa.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/9672668c4c84956b4437e307a1878eaa.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/9672668c4c84956b4437e307a1878eaa.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2bf4d9c876e6de89ba5e4a8206fd4b7a.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2bf4d9c876e6de89ba5e4a8206fd4b7a.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2bf4d9c876e6de89ba5e4a8206fd4b7a.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2c31459c51c7fcda0221b16c5caaa5cf.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div><strong>Try different vehicles to make your factory life easier!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/878942361ad805c73f4ae8b574af3fbc.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/878942361ad805c73f4ae8b574af3fbc.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/878942361ad805c73f4ae8b574af3fbc.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/b85c226e6f734d5c06aa18a17922e0c9.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div>Food Factory is game where players can produce food using various machines starting from gathering base products. Buy lands for your factory, build efficient production lines, expand, gather, explore. Drive more than 10 vehicles, including harvesters, forklifts trucks, pickups and even Tuskla. Export your finished products or deliver them to local sellers. Use different side missions to gather money. You can even furnish your home or factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/3cddae9232a9173b7f24dad5f37375a7.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div><strong>Grow several types of different plants.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/d6acdbf333b31f02347e06cf07c9b799.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/d6acdbf333b31f02347e06cf07c9b799.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/d6acdbf333b31f02347e06cf07c9b799.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/e3fa2840b2a69484f668a9ec557eda08.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div><strong>Build your factory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/9672668c4c84956b4437e307a1878eaa.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/9672668c4c84956b4437e307a1878eaa.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/9672668c4c84956b4437e307a1878eaa.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2bf4d9c876e6de89ba5e4a8206fd4b7a.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2bf4d9c876e6de89ba5e4a8206fd4b7a.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2bf4d9c876e6de89ba5e4a8206fd4b7a.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/2c31459c51c7fcda0221b16c5caaa5cf.avif?t=1752608531\" /></div><strong>Try different vehicles to make your factory life easier!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/878942361ad805c73f4ae8b574af3fbc.poster.avif?t=1752608531\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/878942361ad805c73f4ae8b574af3fbc.webm?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019920/extras/878942361ad805c73f4ae8b574af3fbc.mp4?t=1752608531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
